exports[`CustomerConfirmationEmail > is a receipt with next steps and the 100 lb policy (snapshot) 1`] = `
"You're booked!
Thanks for choosing 951 Express. We received your deposit and your spot is reserved.

YOUR RECEIPT
Booking: 3F2B6C1E
Vehicle: 2021 Toyota RAV4
Route: West → East
Pickup week: Oct 19 – 25
Pickup: 1 Main St, Corona, CA 92882
Delivery: 9 Pier Rd, Unit 2, Baltimore, MD 21201
Load type: Standard
Transport total: $1,500
Deposit paid: $375
Balance due at delivery: $1,125
Estimated delivery: 7–10 days after pickup

Balance due at delivery: Cash, Cashier's Check, or Zelle only. Credit cards are not accepted for the balance.

WHAT HAPPENS NEXT
1. We review your details and contact you to confirm your pickup date within your reserved week.
2. Your driver calls you before pickup and before delivery.
3. You pay the remaining balance to the driver at delivery.

PERSONAL ITEMS
100 lbs included. Anything over 100 lbs is at the driver's discretion.

Questions? Reply to this email or write to 951.dispatcher@gmail.com

951 Express Inc · USDOT 4020917 · MC-1516594
Fully licensed and bonded with a cargo limit of $250,000 per occurrence
951.dispatcher@gmail.com"
`;

